1
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,120
(This story is entirely fictional)

2
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,120
(I spent three months)

3
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,280
(playing her one and only soulmate.)

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,080
(I listened to her crying)

5
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,880
(and validated her anger.)

6
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,600
(She hit me again.)

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,880
(She said I only exist)

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,440
(to be men's lapdog.)

9
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,720
(She said I embarrassed her.)

10
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,760
(She called me
a useless piece of trash.)

11
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,680
(She doesn't care about you.)

12
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:31,000
(Based on novel Doctor Qin: Executer)
(She only cares about her perfect work.)

13
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,480
I know.

14
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,120
But what am I supposed to do?

15
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,160
I hate her.

16
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,000
But I can't leave her.

17
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,560
(I planted a seed in her mind.)

18
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:52,080
(Rebellion is rebirth.)

19
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:55,560
(I taught her
how to cut Su Shi where it hurts.)

20
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,080
(What Su Shi fears most
is Su Tang turning out just like her.)

21
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,440
(And all Su Tang has to do)

22
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:03,240
(is make that deepest fear)

23
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,200
(real)

24
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,800
(and shove it in her face.)

25
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,000
(She's gone mad.)

26
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,000
(A madwoman)

27
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,800
(can't control you anymore.)

28
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,600
(Now)

29
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,600
(it's your turn to control her.)

30
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:19,260
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 22=

31
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,760
Chew the toothpaste a little longer.

32
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,960
It works better that way.

33
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,600
Remember what you're supposed to do.

34
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,840
Tang, time to eat.

35
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,600
Tang.

36
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,600
Tang?

37
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,800
Tang!

38
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,080
Tang.

39
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:30,960
Tang!

40
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:37,200
Tang!

41
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,960
Tang, what are you doing?

42
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,520
Where's the money?

43
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,280
Where did you put the money?

44
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,960
East corner of the cat house.

45
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,280
Under the third flower pot.

46
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:51,280
This is all you'll ever be!

47
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,280
Who are you?

48
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,600
Jin Xiaoxue?

49
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,640
You witch, you corrupted Tang!

50
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,400
Let me out!

51
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,000
Let me out!

52
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,960
Then get on your knees and beg.

53
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,960
Just like you taught
those girls back then.

54
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,400
Told them

55
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,360
how to kneel

56
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,360
to survive.

57
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,600
I was teaching them to face reality!

58
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,960
Don't worry.

59
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,680
I won't kill you.

60
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,040
I'll let you die at the hands

61
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,480
of the most failed piece of work

62
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,760
you ever created.

63
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,200
Tang,

64
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,800
open the cage.

65
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,960
Don't let her mess with your head.

66
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,200
She's a demon.

67
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,360
Don't believe her.

68
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,320
Tang.

69
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,760
Let's kill her together.

70
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,000
Su Tang.

71
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,560
She's lying to you again.

72
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:31,080
Did you forget
how she locked you in the cage?

73
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,320
And how she called you spineless?

74
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:37,080
Tang.

75
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,840
I'm your mom.

76
00:05:41,080 --> 00:05:42,360
The motherly love she talks about

77
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,960
is just chains and cages.

78
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,960
Look at her eyes.

79
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,600
There's no love in them.

80
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,480
Just control.

81
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,440
Kill her.

82
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,760
Kill her and you're free.

83
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,680
Kill this demon

84
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,480
who's been tying you down
your whole life

85
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,560
with chains and curses.

86
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,040
Don't listen to her.

87
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,480
Don't let her mess with your head.

88
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,440
Kill her.

89
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,480
I'll take you away.

90
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,360
I'll take you somewhere with no pain,

91
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,680
somewhere you can start over.

92
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,040
I'm your mom.

93
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,360
I'm your mom.

94
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,840
(Did you forget
how she locked you in the cage?)

95
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:39,960
(The motherly love she talks about)

96
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:41,600
(is just chains and cages.)

97
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,480
(Kill her and you're free.)

98
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,240
(Kill her.)

99
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,040
(Kill her.)

100
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,800
(Fan A71954)

101
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,240
What about Su Tang?

102
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,200
Why her?

103
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,440
That was an accident.

104
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:18,040
I never

105
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,760
wanted her dead.

106
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,080
But

107
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,360
who's to say Su Shi
would definitely get in the cage?

108
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,360
What if she ran?

109
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,360
So

110
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:31,840
I messed with Su Shi's car.

111
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,800
A second layer of insurance.

112
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:45,200
How's Su Tang doing now?

113
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:49,160
She's drowning in regret and guilt.

114
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,160
I want her

115
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,360
to identify me in court.

116
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,440
I want to apologize to her face to face.

117
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:03,160
Mr. Qin, your takeout.

118
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,000
Just put it here.

119
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,760
I never really liked fish balls before.

120
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,840
Until you put them in my bowl.

121
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,160
Officer Qin.

122
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,960
Actually, lots of times

123
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,000
I dreamed

124
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,440
it was you putting the cuffs on me.

125
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:53,840
Lots of times.

126
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,280
Ms. Song, is there something you need?

127
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:08,240
I...

128
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,000
Chen, go do your thing.

129
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,840
Ms. Song, what are you...?

130
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,360
I... I want to see my daughter.

131
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:18,240
But she's under interrogation.
No visitors allowed.

132
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,040
Look.

133
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:23,160
The moment visits are allowed,

134
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,560
I'll let you know.

135
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:31,640
Do you guys feed her?

136
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,000
Of course.

137
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:35,160
Qin Ming ordered takeout for her today.

138
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,640
Good.

139
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,000
I think

140
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,360
I've seen that boy before.

141
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:44,960
He seems nice.

142
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:50,200
I'll get the kids' wedding sorted
when I get a chance.

143
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:55,200
It'd be better
if he ordered some bubble tea.

144
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,160
She loves that stuff.

145
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,360
I remember you had a wild imagination

146
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,000
back in school.

147
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,480
I still do.

148
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,360
So I tried my best to learn.

149
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,840
After all, I deal with a miserable world

150
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,680
every single day.

151
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,640
On Zhang Xiaodong's food chain,

152
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,120
Le Tianyi was the most vicious,

153
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,960
hungriest wild dog.

154
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:52,600
He enjoyed the thrill
of tearing the weak apart.

155
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,080
Because that way,

156
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,840
it let him forget

157
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:58,360
the humiliation
of being controlled by the strong.

158
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,360
So you went to Wang Xuan?

159
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,800
I watched her for a long time.

160
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,560
She'd been broken down by years of

161
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,760
mental abuse and domestic violence.

162
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,360
If I just told her to kill someone,

163
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,200
she wouldn't dare.

164
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,240
So

165
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,400
I had to shatter

166
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:17,200
the last bit of hope
she was holding onto.

167
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,160
The old man smiled and said,

168
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:24,000
"When fate blocks one road,

169
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:28,400
it often leaves another."

170
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,520
(I knew)

171
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,240
(she'd gone numb
from being humiliated for so long.)

172
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,160
(Le Tianyi's cheating on her)

173
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,240
(wasn't enough for her
to make up her mind.)

174
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:35,320
Keep watching.

175
00:13:35,860 --> 00:13:39,180
(House Sale Contract)

176
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,400
Le Tianyi's moving his assets.

177
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:52,320
He's planning to leave you with nothing.

178
00:13:57,640 --> 00:14:00,400
He's even taking away
the last bit of security

179
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,440
you and Niu have.

180
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:05,360
You're still waiting for him
to come back

181
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,000
and save your daughter?

182
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:23,500
(Longfan Second People's Hospital;
Outpatient Medical Record)

183
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:25,800
This is the best brain tumor specialist
in the country.

184
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:29,440
He's the only one
who can do Niu's surgery.

185
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,360
This is for the surgery.

186
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,360
Why

187
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,240
are you helping me?

188
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,280
I'm not helping you.

189
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:49,480
I'm just giving you a choice.

190
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:53,160
You either watch your daughter die

191
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:54,680
and get thrown out,

192
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,160
or you take back what's yours

193
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:59,400
and give Niu a way to live.

194
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:02,920
Location.

195
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:04,280
Tools.

196
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,440
Even what you say

197
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,600
to the cops after he's dead.

198
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,000
I've figured all of this out for you.

199
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:11,880
All you have to do

200
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:14,360
is put a towel over his face

201
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,000
the next time he raises his hand to you.

202
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,360
You've been investigating me this long.

203
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,880
You should know I'm not an idiot.

204
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:28,320
Consider this money

205
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,480
a loan.

206
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,840
But I have one condition.

207
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:35,120
I'll take care of everything for Niu,

208
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,920
until she's an adult.

209
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:39,280
A few years of your life

210
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,960
for her safety for the rest of hers.

211
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:42,520
Do you think

212
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:44,440
that's a fair trade?

213
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,480
You and Wang Xuan
killed Le Tianyi together?

214
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:10,360
No.

215
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:12,040
I changed my mind at the last minute.

216
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:26,440
I'm on my way to the police station!

217
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:28,160
I'll tell you everything I...

218
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:51,220
(Open 24 Hours)

219
00:16:56,760 --> 00:16:57,560
Get out.

220
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:58,680
What's wrong?

221
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,040
You should go.

222
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,840
Niu needs her mom right now.

223
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:29,360
Let me go!

224
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,280
Now!

225
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,520
I said let me go!

226
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:32,520
(High in the tower,)

227
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,320
(the hypocrite builds their nest,)

228
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:37,160
(grinding their struggles into steps,)

229
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:39,600
(and boiling their tears into soup.)

230
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,840
(This man)

231
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,520
(is like a pig that can never
be fed enough!)

232
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,040
Help!

233
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,720
Help me!

234
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,680
Wang Xuan's a victim too.

235
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:00,680
I didn't want her hands
stained with blood.

236
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:03,680
What about you?

237
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,480
I don't care.

238
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:09,320
I just want to wipe out
those scumbags fast.

239
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:16,680
You paid for Niu's surgery?

240
00:18:20,520 --> 00:18:22,240
That day, when I ran into you

241
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:23,640
while I was picking up Niu,

242
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,880
you already suspected me, didn't you?

243
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,160
I was sure whoever came

244
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:30,080
to pick her up was the killer.

245
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:33,480
Until you gave me
another perfect excuse.

246
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,680
Turns out

247
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:36,520
your suspicion was right.

248
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:38,160
Where did you get that kind of money?

249
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:46,880
Put it in.

250
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:48,120
Hurry!

251
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,240
Okay, okay.

252
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,040
You can probably guess.

253
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,440
It's fine.

254
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,360
Hey, let me tell you.

255
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:00,520
I run this place.

256
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:03,520
If anything comes up, you come to me.

257
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,280
I've got your back.

258
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:11,520
We're from
the Longfan Public Security Bureau.

259
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:12,560
You're coming with us.

260
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:20,920
Move.

261
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:23,880
No. I...

262
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:34,840
Qin.

263
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:44,960
Jin Keke was right.

264
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:45,960
We brought him back.

265
00:20:00,040 --> 00:20:01,360
Tell us about Zhang Xiaodong.

266
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:06,080
He liked crocodiles.

267
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:08,440
So I gave him what he wanted.

268
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,920
How did you get him out there alone?

269
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:12,680
Zhang Xiaodong?

270
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,720
Easy.

271
00:20:23,500 --> 00:20:26,390
♪In the fog of the long night♪

272
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:29,720
♪Who hid the truth?♪

273
00:20:30,150 --> 00:20:31,600
♪Good and evil blur♪

274
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:35,800
♪Lies whisper, sinking
into the riverbed of human nature♪

275
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:41,060
♪Hearts are like nameless alleys♪

276
00:20:41,060 --> 00:20:45,170
♪The false facade softens
every smile on their faces♪

277
00:20:49,070 --> 00:20:53,330
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

278
00:20:53,830 --> 00:20:57,870
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

279
00:20:58,180 --> 00:21:02,140
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

280
00:21:02,660 --> 00:21:06,670
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

281
00:21:15,530 --> 00:21:19,410
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

282
00:21:19,410 --> 00:21:22,460
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

283
00:21:22,910 --> 00:21:26,540
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

284
00:21:26,540 --> 00:21:30,760
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

285
00:21:30,760 --> 00:21:35,490
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

286
00:21:35,490 --> 00:21:39,870
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

287
00:21:40,530 --> 00:21:44,300
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

288
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,520
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

289
00:21:57,350 --> 00:22:01,540
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

290
00:22:01,540 --> 00:22:05,900
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

291
00:22:05,900 --> 00:22:09,660
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

292
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:12,580
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

293
00:22:12,580 --> 00:22:17,370
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

294
00:22:17,370 --> 00:22:22,010
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

295
00:22:22,010 --> 00:22:24,310
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

296
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:26,410
♪We stop here in this night♪

297
00:22:26,410 --> 00:22:30,820
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

298
00:22:30,820 --> 00:22:37,140
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

